The Icarus ability catalog was converted from Dart to JSON for Team Playbook
and compacted by storing per-map geometry overrides. See src/catalog.json.
The planar wall files under public/game/vision were generated from the
Icarus 5.2.1 SVG height models. Door coordinates were adapted from
lib/const/map_doors.dart in the same release.
